<html><head><title></title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif" lang="EN-GB">You are about to
reach the top and finalize the results of this phase of the project. But before
you get there, take the time to look back on the participation phase and
everything you have learned together as a group.</span></p>

<p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif" lang="EN-GB">Again, the sharing
circles can be used as a tool to structure the discussion. Appoint a discussion
leader or invite a moderator and prepare the group conversation with already
developed guidelines, for example from <a href="https://www.globallearningpartners.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Sharing-Circle-Guidelines.pdf" style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6;">this
article</a>.</span></p></body></html>